                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is $3.99 with the polish of a $14.99 title. The physics feel good, the game itself is fun and challenging, there are a number of different environments, a few wardrobe pieces to play with, quick chat/emotes, it just has so much for $3.99. It's midnight on the west coast so there was no one online, but like most pvp focused indie/vr titles, I expect there may be a lack of variety of players. The good news is you literally only need to match to one person tho. Some kudos - the developer set it up so the matchmaking function will search while you play against the AI, an excellent feature. \n\nOverall I had fun and for $3.99 that's eight bucks between you and a friend to have another game to add to the VR game night carousel.",
